      "$comment": "Not a bullet in the domain brief's Required standards list. It is the global invariant the standards-system spec requires under its 'Standards integrity invariant' heading, admitted to the series because that spec also requires must-never rules to be first-class standards rather than buried in documentation. Extraction locates it by that heading, not by the bullet scan.",
