      "title": "outcome falsifiability",
      "origin": "evidence",
      "source": null,
      "$comment": "Not stated by either source specification. Derived from the adoption programme: Adoptions #2 and #3 independently produced records that satisfied every rule in the pack while naming, as their resolution source, a value their own run had already computed. Admitted to the series under ADR 0009, which requires an evidence-derived standard to name the committed artifact that disposed of it. It is excluded from the positional comparison against the sources for the obvious reason that no source contains it.",
